# LumineDroid

## Getting started

To get started with Android/LumineDroid, you'll need to get familiar with [Source Control Tools](https://source.android.com/setup/develop).

To initialize your local repository using the LumineDroid trees, use a command like this:

```
repo init -u https://github.com/LumineDroid/platform_manifest.git -b canna --git-lfs
```

Then to sync up:

```
repo sync
```

Please see the [LumineDroid Wiki](https://hub.luminedroid.org/guide/bringup-guide) for building instructions, by device.
